---
# `./ise lint`

profile: moderate

exclude_paths:
  - .venv/
  - exports/
  # One .j2 per ISE object, several hundred of them. They are JSON documents
  # with Jinja in them, not Ansible files; lint has nothing to say about them
  # and walking them is most of the runtime.
  - templates/
  - site-templates/

skip_list:
  # Every task inside tasks/ runs once per catalog entry, so the resource name
  # has to be in the task name or the output is fifty identical lines. Leading
  # with it is what makes a run readable -- `sgt: export via ERS` sorts and
  # scans, `export via ERS: sgt` does not. The rule wants the template at the
  # end; the output is worth more than the rule.
  - name[template]
